Package: sacha
Title:  Biodiversity Data and Image Access, Mapping, and Reporting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marcelo F.", "Amores-Palma", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "contacto.envinatu@gmail.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0337-0467"))
Description: Supports biodiversity research by integrating taxonomic information
    from ChecklistBank and the Catalogue of Life, occurrence records from GBIF,
    and observation photographs from iNaturalist. Provides functions to retrieve
    and format comprehensive, multimodal species profiles encompassing
    nomenclatural, taxonomic, spatial, visual, and bibliographic data. Generates
    maps, image compositions, and Markdown reports for inclusion in scientific
    documents.
